<title>PORTUGAL: Coupon 6.625 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Coupon 6.625 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 20 billion escudos of 10-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: Feb 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 6.625  AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.615</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 20.95 bln esc  HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.66</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.49</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The auction of a new series of 10-year bonds takes to 27.93 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
